{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(48xz-12{x}^{2}z-12x{z}^{2})\\,dz\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $z$, treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(48xz-12{x}^{2}z-12x{z}^{2})\\,dz\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{2}(48xz-12{x}^{2}z-12x{z}^{2})\\,dz]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[24x{z}^{2}-6{x}^{2}{z}^{2}-4x{z}^{3}]_{z=0}^{z=2}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(64x-24{x}^{2})\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(64x-24{x}^{2})\\,dx & ={[32{x}^{2}-8{x}^{3}]}_{x=0}^{x=1} \\\\  & =(32-8)-0 \\\\  & =24.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186281291 :question/problem "Evaluate the mixed integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}6y\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}A\n$$\n\ngiven that the region $D$ in the $xz$-plane is given by\n\n$$\nD=\\{(x,z)\\,:\\,0\\le z\\le 1-x,\\,0\\le x\\le 1\\}.\n$$"] [17592186281319 :question/problem "Evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}4x\\,dV\n$$\n\nwhere the region $R$ is given by\n\n$$\nR=\\{(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,z)\\in D,\\,{x}^{2}\\le y\\le 1\\},\n$$\n\nand $D$ is a finite region in $xz$-plane enclosed between the $x$-axis, the $z$-axis, and the curve $z+{x}^{2}=1$ in the first quadrant."] ["question-78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b" :question/id #uuid "78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b"] ["question-78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b" :question/math-academy-id "q-164349"] ["question-78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b" :question/problem "![](images/78/78c5b7d059cac1d2ad94edf93a3d9317a62e5c1d1c88a4be29c49bbe9dac5f39.png)\n\nGiven that $R$ is the type III region shown above, \n${∭}_{R}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}V=$"] ["question-78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b" :question/worked-solution "For a type III region $R$ with projection $D$ onto the $xz$-plane, the triple integral of a continuous function $f(x,y,z)$ over $R$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{{u}_{1}(x,z)}^{{u}_{2}(x,z)}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe consider the region $R$ as a type III region enclosed between the back surface $y={u}_{1}(x,z)=2$ and the front surface $y={u}_{2}(x,z)=6.$\n\n![](images/a0/a03d6986874a543bc21d274433b5268444f2487aea198834d379f004a7d85e79.png)\n\nSo, the region $R$ is given by\n\n$$\nR=\\{(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,z)\\in D,\\,2\\le y\\le 6\\}.\n$$\n\nNow, we consider the projection $D$ as a type I *plane* region in the $xz$-plane with the upper curve\n\n$$\nz=1-x.\n$$\n\n![](images/06/06e8986d493efbe696751db410f84490ba634c9f68feaa03aa0bf9d71593feb3.png)\n\nHence, $D=\\{(x,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le z\\le 1-x\\}.$\n\nTherefore, we write the triple integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}V & ={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{2}^{6}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x}[{\\int }_{2}^{6}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x}{x}^{2}[y]_{y=2}^{y=6}\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x}4{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-b4d91747-a788-57b5-b27b-550a878336f2" :answer-field/id #uuid "b4d91747-a788-57b5-b27b-550a878336f2"] ["answer-e774e34d-ed51-5d51-b55f-fe1ccb615316" :answer/id #uuid "e774e34d-ed51-5d51-b55f-fe1ccb615316"] ["answer-e774e34d-ed51-5d51-b55f-fe1ccb615316" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e774e34d-ed51-5d51-b55f-fe1ccb615316" :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x}4{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x"] ["answer-3a1dfd9a-580f-544f-8d77-20ab90892309" :answer/id #uuid "3a1dfd9a-580f-544f-8d77-20ab90892309"] ["answer-3a1dfd9a-580f-544f-8d77-20ab90892309" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3a1dfd9a-580f-544f-8d77-20ab90892309" :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x}\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x"] ["answer-8f4d7c9b-5084-5