stions "question-78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/id #uuid "b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf"] ["step-584a6f1d-7daa-56a7-b438-a33d62c99067" :step/id #uuid "584a6f1d-7daa-56a7-b438-a33d62c99067"] ["step-d4f52355-bc41-52e2-acb1-84fccf2c578e" :step/id #uuid "d4f52355-bc41-52e2-acb1-84fccf2c578e"] ["step-7daf2a73-2425-568d-93d8-9ecb67de0d98" :step/id #uuid "7daf2a73-2425-568d-93d8-9ecb67de0d98"] ["step-c04ddbb0-06ea-5d6c-a8b3-e6a0600ff993" :step/id #uuid "c04ddbb0-06ea-5d6c-a8b3-e6a0600ff993"] ["step-95b50fbb-45c2-5a7d-a86b-c6b9c74dc2fa" :step/id #uuid "95b50fbb-45c2-5a7d-a86b-c6b9c74dc2fa"] ["step-584a6f1d-7daa-56a7-b438-a33d62c99067" :step/content 17592186134291] ["step-584a6f1d-7daa-56a7-b438-a33d62c99067" :step/next "step-d4f52355-bc41-52e2-acb1-84fccf2c578e"] ["step-d4f52355-bc41-52e2-acb1-84fccf2c578e" :step/content 17592186134127] ["step-d4f52355-bc41-52e2-acb1-84fccf2c578e" :step/next "step-7daf2a73-2425-568d-93d8-9ecb67de0d98"] ["step-7daf2a73-2425-568d-93d8-9ecb67de0d98" :step/content 17592186281291] ["step-7daf2a73-2425-568d-93d8-9ecb67de0d98" :step/next "step-c04ddbb0-06ea-5d6c-a8b3-e6a0600ff993"] ["step-c04ddbb0-06ea-5d6c-a8b3-e6a0600ff993" :step/content 17592186281319] ["step-c04ddbb0-06ea-5d6c-a8b3-e6a0600ff993" :step/next "step-95b50fbb-45c2-5a7d-a86b-c6b9c74dc2fa"] ["step-95b50fbb-45c2-5a7d-a86b-c6b9c74dc2fa" :step/content "question-78d73ab6-dc58-5b09-8f0f-74be4ef20e0b"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/title "Triple Integrals Over Type III Regions"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/type :activity.type/review] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/scope 17592186050165] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/course 17592186046660] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/steps "step-584a6f1d-7daa-56a7-b438-a33d62c99067"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/steps "step-d4f52355-bc41-52e2-acb1-84fccf2c578e"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/steps "step-7daf2a73-2425-568d-93d8-9ecb67de0d98"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/steps "step-c04ddbb0-06ea-5d6c-a8b3-e6a0600ff993"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/steps "step-95b50fbb-45c2-5a7d-a86b-c6b9c74dc2fa"] ["activity-b2253863-a2eb-5d06-8e91-3826f6e8edbf" :activity/first-step "step-584a6f1d-7daa-56a7-b438-a33d62c99067"]] "retractions" [[17592186134291 :question/problem "Evaluate the triple integral\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}2x\\,\\text{d}V\n$$\n\nwhere $R$ is the type III region given by \n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,{x}^{2}\\le z\\le 2{x}^{2},\\,0\\le y\\le 2xz}.\n$$"] [17592186134127 :question/worked-solution "![](images/c1/c1853c772e219f53a0b394bd0b50beea6b33c451afc453983cdccb1df333c5ea.png)\n\n \n\nNotice that our solid can be written as the type III region\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,z)\\in D,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 4-x-z},\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\nD={(x,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le z\\le 2}\n$$\n\nis the projection of $R$ onto the $xz$-plane, shown below.\n\n![](images/06/0620f8f25174cb71528049341669458c68a7ccfdd3ff76b5f62c878307080419.png)\n\nHence, the type III representation of $R$ is\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le z\\le 2,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 4-x-z}\n$$\n\nAs a result, by writing down our triple integral as a repeated integral, we obtain\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}12xz\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{4-x-z}12xz\\,dy\\,dz\\,dx.\n$$\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $y$, treating $x$ and $z$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{4-x-z}12xz\\,dy\\,dz\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{4-x-z}12xz\\,dy]dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}12xz[y]_{y=0}^{y=4-x-z}\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}12xz(4-x-z)\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(48xz-12{x}^{2}z-12x{z}^{2})\\,dz\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $z$, treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(48xz-12{x}^{2}z-12x{z}^{2})\\,dz\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{2}(48xz-12{x}^{2}z-12x{z}^{2})\\,dz]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[24x{z}^{2}-6{x}^{2}{z}^{2}-4x{z}^{3}]_{z=0}^{z=2}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(64x-24{x}^{2})\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(64x-24{x}^{2})\\,dx & ={[32{x}^{2}-8{x}^{3}]}_{x=0}^{x=1} \\\\  & =(32-8)-0 \\\\  & =24.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186281291 :question/problem "Evaluate the mixed integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}6y\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}A\n$$\n\ngiven that the region $D$ in the $xz$-plane is given by\n\n$$\nD={(x,z)\\,:\\,0\\le z\\le 1-x,\\,0\\le x\\le 1}.\n$$"] [17592186281319 :question/problem "Evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}4x\\,dV\n$$\n\nwhere the region $R$ is given by\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,z)\\in D,\\,{x}^{2}\\le y\\le 1},\n$$\n\nand $D$ is a finite region in $xz$-plane enclosed between the $x$-axis, the $z$-axis, and the curve $z+{x}^{2}=1$ in the first quadrant."]]}]